cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this reproducibility package, please cite it as below."
license: MIT
title: "Word order in Slovenian: reproducibility package"
abstract: >-
  Scripts, canonical result tables and figures reproducing the quantitative
  subject-verb-object word-order analyses of a master's thesis on genre and
  register variation in Slovenian.
type: software
repository-code: "https://github.com/hulln/slovene-word-order-repro"
url: "https://github.com/hulln/slovene-word-order-repro"
authors:
